 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You were on the Portuguese ship. The storm did not like her.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The storm did not like any of us. I took the chance it gave.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You are Maratha.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You fought them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Our king fights them too. And their cousins, the Dutch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "He will want to hear what you have seen.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Who is your king?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You will learn his names and his titles in good time.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "For now, think of him as the man whose land you lie on. And whose patience with Europeans is thin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "Can he travel?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "HEALER (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "He should rest another week, but you will not wait. Men like you never do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "Men like me are paid to be impatient.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Can you ride in a cart, or on a horse?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I can sit. I can walk, if there is no better way.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "There is a better way, though you will not like it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Come.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Pepper.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "It sits in the lungs. It pays for guns.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And for kings. That too.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "We send word ahead. Our people are the vines that run along this coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "We carry news as well as goods.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "What do you tell them?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "That I found a branded Maratha officer on our beach. That he still has both eyes and more teeth than one would expect from the Viceroy's dungeons.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "That he speaks like a man who has led horse into gunfire and lived.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "A man like that has value.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "The question is always to whom.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (small)"
   ],
   "text": "Rest. The road is long, and the bulls do not hurry.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Your people. What do they think of this coast?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They think of it when they want money.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We have learned to ride down toward the ports, strike at caravans and warehouses, ride back before your masters answer.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Your masters. Not you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I serve, as all men serve. But I know the difference between a fort built to defend a people and a fort built to protect a treasury.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Our fortresses are both. You will see.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "BOY (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "Who is he?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "A man who thought he could drown, then changed his mind.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OLD WOMAN (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "That one carries storms in his bones.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "I told her you carry horses there too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Storms and horses can both be useful, if you know how to ride them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Beyond these hills, the land belongs to men who answer only to the king. They do not like uninvited guests.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And with you?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "With me you are still an uninvited guest. But one whose arrival has been announced.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "You come late, *kapitan*.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "The sea does not consult my schedule.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "This is the man I sent word about.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "He looks like he should already be dead.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "He disagrees. Our king might too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (whisper)"
   ],
   "text": "This is not the king. He is busy elsewhere.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (whisper)"
   ],
   "text": "This is one of his hands on this coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "You bring me shipwreck.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "The sea brought him. I only stopped the crabs from finishing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "Name.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Nagoji Sawant.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (off, Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "Service?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "*Huzurat* cavalry. Household horse under Chimaji Appa. Until the Portuguese netted me.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "You raided them?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "You know their forts?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Some.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "Our king sharpens his sword for the Dutch now. And for those local chiefs who think they can hide behind European flags.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "He has horse from Madurai, musketeers of his own, ships that slip between the foreign hulls at night.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICIAL (Malayalam)"
   ],
   "text": "What does a Maratha rider know that he does not already have?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Your king knows his own land. He knows these hills, these backwaters, which chiefs will bend and which must be broken.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch and the Portuguese know their books and their drills.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I know how men like them think when they stand on foreign soil and believe God and powder have made them superior.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
